<title>FRANCE: Havas sees stable 1997 earnings per share.</title>
<headline>Havas sees stable 1997 earnings per share.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French media group Havas said on Friday it expected 1997 net earnings per share to be stable.</p>
<p>In 1996 net earnings per share were 19 francs, up from 17.50 francs in 1995.</p>
<p>Havas said in a statement released at a news conference, &quot;In 1997, advertising markets should see a greater expansion than in 1996.&quot;</p>
